      "message": "should we issue a warning when there are unknown fields? or make it an option as to if unknown fields should be ignored?\n\nI am concerned that if someone has a type in their POST data then this could mask it and they wouldn\u0027t really have a way to troubleshoot the issue as to why it didn\u0027t work.\n\nBy at least allowing a deployment to configure to \"strict\" mode you would, at some level, be able to determine if the incoming request was valid or not.\n\nIn short, I am not sure we should be ignoring unknown fields.",
